  "specific_checks": [
    "new sessions restore canonical policy files before planning",
    "healthy outputs are never destroyed by downstream failures",
    "parallel workers cannot claim or mutate the same task without a lease",
    "critical side effects are blocked by pre-execution guardrails",
    "agent loops always have time request token or message termination conditions",
    "cache is never treated as the sole durable checkpoint store",
    "final video validation includes ffprobe and decode-level error checking when a video is eventually produced",
    "successful lanes are not needlessly re-run",
    "clipping source rights are verified before any edit enters the publishable queue",
    "platform originality eligibility and copyright permission are evaluated independently",
    "third-party monetized clips retain a human publication approval gate",
    "missing revoked or expired license blocks publishing",
    "near-duplicate mass output and engagement manipulation are blocked",
    "TikTok Shop scripts ingest current product-page and official-source evidence before factual claims are finalized",
    "local reviews retain original language and are deduplicated clustered and scoped before consensus wording",
    "first-three-second hooks do not contain unsupported numeric comparative scarcity or testimonial claims",
    "storytelling may improve persuasion but never upgrades evidence grade",
    "price coupon stock shipping and other volatile commerce facts are refreshed before publication",
    "AIGC rule and labeling requirements are refreshed before publication",
    "winning commerce creatives may update generation heuristics but never relax evidence policy or safety gates"
  ],
